[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SRS019
TITLE: Propose a routine clearance only when the guard can accept it
STATEMENT: >>>
The Tower CSCI shall auto-issue a routine taxi, hold-short, line-up, takeoff, landing, or vacate only by proposing a command that the separation guard accepts. The proposal shall be made only after the conflict probe reports safe. A scripted radio reply shall not be a second writer of that clearance. Acceptance is a taxi request that becomes an assign or hold-short only through the guard, and a conflicting request that is absent from the issued log.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Routine issuance is a suggestion the occupancy guard still has to commit.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Commands the guard does not know are not issued.
